#adm/daemons/mailmesg.c
remain ({"smore",})
mesg "Dear Smore:	I have found the mistake you made.	And I fixed and put the file in /u/m/mad/knight.c	You will know why the knight couldn't defend Las.	Although I have debugged, the knight has no ability	to protect Las perfectly since the defend system	isn't perfect.	By the way, I think these two monsters are too terrible.	You should write some reasons in your files, otherwise,	I might modify them as you don't like.			Sincerely yours, Mad."
